#: ../../../../docs/explanation/source-map.md:14
msgid "Core"
msgstr "Core"

#: ../../../../core/README.md:2
msgid "Core contracts"
msgstr "Core 合同"

#: ../../../../core/README.md:4
msgid ""
"C11 caller-owned request admission, stable control identities, completion "
"state and monotonic absolute deadlines. No devices, OS scheduler, allocation"
" or global registry. Public interfaces are in `include/nexus/core`."
msgstr ""
"C11 调用者拥有的请求准入、稳定控制身份、完成状态和绝对单调截止时间。不包含设备、OS 调度器、分配或全局登记表。公共接口位于 "
"`include/nexus/core`。"

#: ../../../../core/README.md:8
msgid ""
"REJECTED retains no references. An accepted chain borrows request and "
"buffers until acquire-observed SETTLED. SETTLED is its last request access. "
"Cancel/timeouts never revoke a borrow; failed drain keeps QUARANTINED "
"storage alive. Producers wait on latched state; a single executor services "
"the operation. Queue adapters own their outer request and use explicit inner"
" provider metadata where needed."
msgstr ""
"REJECTED 不保留任何引用。接受的请求链借用 request 和 buffer，直到调用者以 acquire 观察到 "
"SETTLED。SETTLED 的发布是其对请求的最后一次访问。取消／超时绝不撤销借用；排空失败后仍保持 QUARANTINED "
"存储有效。生产者等待锁存状态，由唯一执行者推进操作。队列适配器拥有外层请求，并按需要使用显式内层提供者元数据。"

#: ../../../../core/README.md:14
msgid ""
"`tests/contracts/core_contract_test.c` executes publication, admission, "
"wrapping time arithmetic and terminal-state invariants. Host results do not "
"prove MCU interrupt ordering or worst-case execution time."
msgstr ""
"`tests/contracts/core_contract_test.c` 实际验证发布、准入、回绕时间运算和终态不变量。主机结果不能证明 MCU "
"中断顺序或最坏执行时间。"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/source-map.md:21
msgid "Arch"
msgstr "Arch"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:2
msgid "CPU-local primitives"
msgstr "CPU 本地原语"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:4
msgid ""
"`Nexus::Arch` exposes saved interrupt masks, exact exception identity, "
"current privilege, ordering barriers and an optional already-enabled DWT "
"cycle snapshot. It does not call I/O, OS or vendor SDK code. One compile-"
"time Cortex-M primitive implementation covers "
"M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85, including ARMv8.1-M Mainline compiler "
"profiles. STM32F407 and GD32F470 maintain the initial platform scope; G474, "
"H743 and U575 provide explicit reference slices described in the [support "
"matrix](/delivery/support.md). CPU support does not extend those SoC or "
"Board slices. The separate CPU runtime assembly selects Core/Arch and "
"optional OS software for all nine cores without creating a SoC, Board, "
"startup or factory. See [CPU contracts](/design/arch-contracts.md) and the "
"[runtime assembly example](/delivery/cortex-m.md)."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::Arch` 暴露保存／恢复中断屏蔽、准确异常身份、当前特权级、顺序屏障及可选的已启用 DWT 周期快照。它不调用 I/O、OS 或厂商 "
"SDK。一个编译期 Cortex-M 原语实现覆盖 M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85，包括 ARMv8.1-M "
"Mainline 编译配置。STM32F407 与 GD32F470 维持首发平台范围；G474、H743、U575 "
"提供[支持矩阵](/delivery/support.md)中的明确参考切片。CPU 支持不扩大这些 SoC 或 Board 切片。独立 CPU "
"runtime 装配为全部九核选择 Core/Arch 及可选 OS 软件，不创建 SoC、Board、startup 或 factory。详见 "
"[CPU 合同](/design/arch-contracts.md)和 [runtime 装配示例](/delivery/cortex-m.md)。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:16
msgid ""
"Save/restore tokens on the same CPU/thread in strict reverse order. Cortex-M"
" preserves incoming PRIMASK and does not overwrite BASEPRI/FAULTMASK where "
"those registers exist. Only privileged Task/configurable-IRQ callers may "
"change masks. NMI and HardFault remain unmasked and must not access this "
"protected metadata. Keep metadata sections short: no blocking, allocation, "
"large copies, kernel calls or user callbacks. A saved Arch token is not a "
"kernel critical-section token or an SMP lock."
msgstr ""
"必须在同一 CPU／线程上严格逆序保存／恢复 token。Cortex-M 保持进入时的 PRIMASK，并在相应寄存器存在时不覆盖 "
"BASEPRI/FAULTMASK。只有特权 Task／可配置 IRQ 调用者可以修改屏蔽。NMI 与 HardFault "
"保持未屏蔽，且不得访问这些受保护元数据。元数据临界区必须短小：不得阻塞、分配、大量复制、调用内核或用户回调。已保存的 Arch token "
"不是内核临界区 token，也不是 SMP 锁。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:24
msgid ""
"Mask/context queries let blocking I/O reject contexts that prevent its "
"progress. The read-only mask snapshot distinguishes PRIMASK, BASEPRI and "
"FAULTMASK; it is not a restore token and does not freeze interrupt or "
"security-world execution. Baseline M0/M0+/M23 queries never read absent "
"BASEPRI/FAULTMASK. Handler mode is privileged even when CONTROL.nPRIV "
"describes an interrupted unprivileged Thread. An exception number identifies"
" the current CPU/security state; it does not grant permission to call a "
"kernel ISR API or coordinate another security world. DMB/DSB/ISB encode "
"different ordering guarantees; they do not prove peripheral or DMA "
"quiescence. DWT snapshots require an explicit reviewed CPU capability and "
"privileged access. A disabled capability emits no DWT reads. Snapshots do "
"not enable or reset the counter and are not monotonic deadlines. Their "
"wrap/frequency limits are documented in the header. Reviewed capabilities "
"are explicit CPU facts, never inferred by probing arbitrary registers or "
"enabling optional units."
msgstr ""
"屏蔽／上下文查询允许阻塞 I/O 拒绝会阻碍其推进的上下文。只读屏蔽快照区分 PRIMASK、BASEPRI、FAULTMASK；它不是恢复 "
"token，也不冻结中断或安全世界执行。Baseline M0/M0+/M23 查询绝不读取不存在的 BASEPRI/FAULTMASK。即使 "
"CONTROL.nPRIV 描述的是被打断的非特权 Thread，Handler 模式仍为特权。异常号识别当前 CPU／安全状态，不授予内核 ISR "
"API 调用权限，也不协调另一安全世界。DMB/DSB/ISB 具有不同顺序保证，不能证明外设或 DMA 静止。DWT 快照要求显式审查的 CPU "
"能力和特权访问；能力禁用时不产生 DWT 读取。快照不启用或复位计数器，也不是单调截止时间；回绕／频率限制见头文件。已审查能力是明确 CPU "
"事实，绝不能通过探测任意寄存器或启用可选单元来推断。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:38
msgid ""
"`sleep.h` exposes two explicit shallow-sleep operations. The masked "
"`nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt()` requires privileged Thread mode, PRIMASK=1, "
"BASEPRI/FAULTMASK clear and SCR.SLEEPDEEP clear. It executes DSB/WFI/ISB "
"without changing masks, clocks or pending interrupts. The caller owns the "
"final readiness check and an enabled IRQ wake source; a pending enabled IRQ "
"wakes WFI despite PRIMASK and runs after the caller restores its saved mask."
" `nx_arch_idle_if_unchanged()` instead requires all incoming masks clear, "
"saves PRIMASK, rechecks an aligned published sequence with acquire semantics"
" and sleeps only when it still matches the caller's snapshot. It restores "
"the exact incoming mask; the caller retries the authoritative predicate and "
"supplies an IRQ timer for finite deadlines. This is one CPU and one security"
" state's publication domain. NMI/HardFault, DMA, SMP and other security-"
"world publishers are excluded. Native reports unsupported. Compiler/model "
"evidence does not qualify a concrete timer, clock continuity, physical power"
" behavior or wake latency."
msgstr ""
"`sleep.h` 暴露两个显式浅睡眠操作。屏蔽模式的 `nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt()` 要求特权 "
"Thread、PRIMASK=1、BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 清零且 SCR.SLEEPDEEP 清零。它执行 "
"DSB/WFI/ISB，不改变屏蔽、时钟或 pending 中断。调用者负责最后就绪检查及已启用 IRQ 唤醒源；即使 PRIMASK "
"已置位，pending 的已启用 IRQ 仍可唤醒 WFI，并在调用者恢复保存的屏蔽后执行。`nx_arch_idle_if_unchanged()` "
"则要求进入时全部屏蔽清零，保存 PRIMASK，再以 acquire "
"语义重新检查对齐的已发布序列；仅仍与调用者快照匹配时睡眠。它恢复准确进入屏蔽；调用者重新检查权威谓词，并为有限截止时间供给 IRQ 定时器。这是单 "
"CPU、单安全状态的发布域，排除 NMI/HardFault、DMA、SMP 和另一安全世界发布者。Native "
"返回不支持。编译器／模型证据不建立具体定时器、时钟连续性、物理功耗行为或唤醒延迟资格。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:53
msgid ""
"`cache.h` exposes distinct data clean, invalidate, combined maintenance and "
"instruction synchronization. Every range must own complete reviewed 32-byte "
"lines, fit the CPU address space and be quiescent across CPU/DMA/security "
"users. The functions do not round ranges, enable caches or flush unrelated "
"dirty lines. `cache_control.h` separately owns cold M7 transitions. The "
"caller supplies one zero-initialized control object, masks configurable "
"interrupts and excludes DMA and all other memory users. Trusted reset or a "
"prior successful owned clean/disable establishes cold state; clear CCR bits "
"alone cannot prove that foreign dirty lines are absent. Enable rejects pre-"
"existing caches; disable cleans every reviewed data set/way and changes CCR "
"in a leaf that cannot dirty its own stack. Failed partial changes retain "
"cache/CSSELR recovery responsibility. Actual instruction audits verify "
"addresses, loops and barriers at O0/Os/O2. Other CPU profiles remain "
"unsupported by this cold-control API; their range maintenance capability "
"does not imply a reviewed global cache transition. `mpu.h` retains distinct "
"v7-format and v8 base/limit/MAIR encoders. Single-region programming "
"requires an already masked privileged Thread and disabled MPU; actual TYPE "
"bounds and fields are checked before writes. CTRL and incoming RNR are "
"preserved. Memory policy and any later enable operation belong to the "
"caller. The optional M0+ MPU uses the v7-format registers confirmed by "
"CMSIS."
msgstr ""
"`cache.h` 分别暴露数据 clean、invalidate、组合维护及指令同步。每个范围必须独占完整、已审查的 32 字节行，位于 CPU "
"地址空间内，并在 CPU/DMA／安全用户之间保持静止。函数不扩展对齐范围、不启用缓存、不刷新无关脏行。`cache_control.h` 单独拥有 "
"M7 冷态转换。调用者供给一个零初始化控制对象，屏蔽可配置中断，并排除 DMA 及全部其他内存使用者。可信复位或此前成功的自有 "
"clean/disable 建立冷态；仅 CCR 位清零不能证明不存在外来脏行。Enable 拒绝已有启用缓存；disable 清理全部已审查数据 "
"set/way，并在不会弄脏自身栈的叶函数中修改 CCR。部分变更失败后保留缓存／CSSELR 恢复责任。实际指令审计在 O0/Os/O2 "
"验证地址、循环和屏障。其他 CPU 配置不受此冷控制 API 支持；其范围维护能力不暗示已审查的全局缓存转换。`mpu.h` 分开保留 v7 格式和 "
"v8 base/limit/MAIR 编码器。单区域编程要求已屏蔽的特权 Thread 及关闭的 MPU；写入前检查实际 TYPE 边界与字段。CTRL"
" 和进入时 RNR 保持不变。内存策略和后续 enable 属于调用者。可选 M0+ MPU 使用 CMSIS 确认的 v7 格式寄存器。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:73
msgid ""
"`security.h` identifies the reviewed image state and encodes explicit SAU "
"regions. Only a Secure compiler/profile with reviewed SAU regions can "
"program one owned region, while SAU is disabled and the privileged Thread "
"has PRIMASK set. No API changes SAU CTRL/ALLNS, another region, Secure "
"gateways or another world's alias. NonSecure and single-domain images return"
" unsupported without SAU MMIO. IDAU, overlap rules, memory permissions and "
"gateway policy stay outside these mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"`security.h` 识别已审查镜像状态并编码显式 SAU 区域。只有带已审查 SAU 区域的 Secure 编译器／配置可以编程一个自有区域，且 "
"SAU 必须关闭、特权 Thread 已设置 PRIMASK。API 不修改 SAU CTRL/ALLNS、其他区域、Secure "
"网关或另一安全世界别名。NonSecure 和单域镜像在不访问 SAU MMIO "
"的情况下返回不支持。IDAU、重叠规则、内存权限与网关策略位于这些机制之外。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:80
msgid ""
"`nonsecure.h` supplies an instantaneous Secure Thread observation of a "
"complete span using the actual CMSE NonSecure unprivileged read or "
"read/write check. It needs no programmable SAU when an IDAU establishes "
"attribution. Native, single-state and NonSecure images return unsupported "
"without crossing domains. Success does not pin, copy, authenticate, exclude "
"MMIO or freeze mappings, DMA and bus firewall policy. SoC and gateway owners"
" must separately establish these conditions before accessing memory or "
"performing an operation."
msgstr ""
"`nonsecure.h` 使用真实 CMSE NonSecure 非特权读或读写检查，提供 Secure Thread 对完整范围的瞬时观察。若 "
"IDAU 已建立属性，则不需要可编程 SAU。Native、单状态和 NonSecure 镜像不跨域，直接返回不支持。成功不表示 "
"pin、复制、鉴权、排除 MMIO，或冻结映射、DMA 和总线防火墙策略。SoC 与网关所有者必须在访问内存或执行操作之前，分别建立这些条件。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:88
msgid ""
"`features.h` reports immutable reviewed cache/MPU/DWT/security/SAU "
"capabilities, not enabled state or hardware qualification. Native exposes "
"the same APIs with absent-hardware results; pure encoders remain usable. "
"Extending CPU mechanisms does not provide a SoC startup, vector table, clock"
" tree, memory/DMA routes, Board wiring or an RTOS FPU/MVE context port. Each"
" new platform must supply and verify those boundaries independently. "
"Publication and RMW atomics have separate contracts in `atomic.h`; CPU-"
"specific fallback never silently links libatomic. Aligned acquire/release "
"word loads and stores do not mask IRQs. M0/M0+ RMW uses bounded saved-"
"PRIMASK exclusion and restores the incoming mask; all concurrent users must "
"be privileged local Thread/configurable-IRQ callers. NMI, HardFault, another"
" core, DMA and another security world are outside this exclusion domain. "
"Other maintained cores use compiler lock-free RMW; exclusive retries do not "
"establish a fixed cycle bound. Initialize words before publication and "
"retain their lifetime until every reader/writer has stopped."
msgstr ""
"`features.h` 报告不可变、已审查的 cache/MPU/DWT/security/SAU 能力，不报告启用状态或硬件资格。Native "
"暴露相同 API，但返回硬件不存在结果；纯编码器仍可使用。扩展 CPU 机制不提供 SoC startup、向量表、时钟树、内存／DMA "
"路由、Board 接线或 RTOS FPU/MVE 上下文端口。每个新平台必须独立供给并验证这些边界。发布及 RMW 原子操作在 `atomic.h` "
"中具有独立合同；CPU 特定回退绝不隐式链接 libatomic。对齐的 acquire/release 字加载和存储不屏蔽 IRQ。M0/M0+ "
"RMW 使用有界、保存 PRIMASK 的互斥机制，并恢复进入屏蔽；全部并发使用者必须是本地特权 Thread／可配置 IRQ "
"调用者。NMI、HardFault、其他核、DMA 和另一安全世界位于互斥域之外。其他维护核使用编译器无锁 RMW；exclusive "
"重试不建立固定周期上限。发布前初始化字，并保持其生命周期直到每个读者／写者停止。"

#: ../../../../arch/README.md:103
msgid ""
"Native models recursive exclusion and C11 fences; it does not model real "
"NVIC, DMA, physical timing or signal-safe interrupts. Invalid restore "
"nesting aborts in both Debug and Release. GoogleTest/GoogleMock compiles the"
" real Cortex-M algorithm against a narrow register/instruction hardware "
"boundary for nine CPU profiles; the normal ARM path inlines that boundary "
"and never links the mocks. Native tests exercise real recursive exclusion, "
"strict token nesting and context queries. Cache, MPU and security models "
"mock only external CPU/MMIO operations and run the production C algorithms, "
"including rejection before state changes. Pinned CMSIS "
"`core_cm0plus/7/23/33/55/85.h`, `mpu_armv7/8.h` and `cachel1_armv7.h` "
"establish the maintained register layouts. Actual IRQ latency, privilege "
"transitions, DMA/cache coherency and CPU timing require HIL."
msgstr ""
"Native 模拟递归互斥与 C11 屏障，不模拟真实 NVIC、DMA、物理时序或信号安全中断。Debug 与 Release "
"都会在非法恢复嵌套时中止。GoogleTest/GoogleMock 在九种 CPU 配置中，以窄寄存器／指令硬件边界编译真实 Cortex-M "
"算法；普通 ARM 路径内联该边界，绝不链接 mock。Native 测试执行真实递归互斥、严格 token 嵌套和上下文查询。缓存、MPU、安全模型只"
" mock 外部 CPU/MMIO 操作，运行生产 C 算法，包括在状态变更前拒绝。锁定 CMSIS 的 "
"`core_cm0plus/7/23/33/55/85.h`、`mpu_armv7/8.h`、`cachel1_armv7.h` "
"建立维护范围内的寄存器布局。实际 IRQ 延迟、特权转换、DMA／缓存一致性与 CPU 时序需要 HIL。"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/source-map.md:28 ../../../../io/README.md:2
msgid "Typed I/O"
msgstr "类型化 I/O"

#: ../../../../io/README.md:17
msgid ""
"Public operations check the face and dispatch its exact context. Different "
"provider tables can coexist in one image without redefining public symbols. "
"A missing optional method reports `NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`; invalid faces "
"reject before provider access. A method must preserve the public operation's"
" execution, deadline, buffer ownership and failure contract. Provider "
"headers, register layouts and SDK types stay private."
msgstr ""
"公共操作检查接口面并分派其准确 context。不同提供者方法表可以共存于同一镜像，不重新定义公共符号。缺失可选方法返回 "
"`NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`；非法接口面在访问提供者前拒绝。方法必须保持公共操作的执行、截止时间、缓冲区所有权和失败合同。提供者头文件、寄存器布局与"
" SDK 类型保持私有。"

#: ../../../../io/README.md:24
msgid ""
"Generated typed factory IDs select instances and distinguish SPI/I2C "
"controllers from their child endpoints. Lookup returns a static identity. "
"Platform start, request admission, service, recovery and stop remain "
"explicit; lookup performs no hardware initialization, allocation, name "
"search or locking. Faces remain valid while provider storage exists, so "
"stopping requires caller and IRQ quiescence rather than promising that a "
"pointer has been revoked."
msgstr ""
"生成的类型化 factory ID 选择实例，并区分 SPI/I2C 控制器及子端点。查找返回静态身份。Platform "
"启动、请求准入、service、恢复和停止均保持显式；查找不初始化硬件、不分配、不搜索名称、不加锁。提供者存储存在时接口面仍有效，因此停止要求调用者和 "
"IRQ 静止，不能承诺指针已被撤销。"

#: ../../../../io/README.md:31
msgid ""
"Stream reserve, publish, acquire, release, abort and stop access constant "
"metadata independent of block count. Stop checks an outstanding-block count;"
" filling, ready and borrowed blocks remain counted until proved abort or "
"matching release. It never scans the block array or revokes a loan under the"
" interrupt mask. Storage overlap validation remains a cold assembly "
"operation whose work grows with block count. This complexity contract is not"
" physical IRQ latency or cycle qualification."
msgstr ""
"Stream reserve、publish、acquire、release、abort、stop 访问的元数据数量固定，不随块数变化。Stop 检查 "
"outstanding-block 计数；filling、ready、borrowed 块均保持计数，直到已证明 abort 或匹配 "
"release。它不在中断屏蔽期间扫描块数组或撤销借用。存储重叠验证仍为冷装配操作，其工作量随块数增长。该复杂度合同不建立物理 IRQ 延迟或周期资格。"

#: ../../../../io/README.md:39
msgid ""
"Default paths need no OS locks or hidden tasks. Requests and transfer "
"buffers remain caller-owned; generated provider buffers are assembly-owned "
"and separate. UART tracks physical TC separately from loaded bytes and "
"request release; error-only RX events never invent data. SPI and I2C "
"preserve their bounded polling contracts, and controller recovery never "
"replays a failed transaction. Flash exposes physical geometry; products "
"provide explicit restricted regions."
msgstr ""
"默认路径不需要 OS 锁或隐藏任务。Request 与传输缓冲区由调用者拥有；生成提供者缓冲区归装配所有且单独存在。UART 分别跟踪物理 "
"TC、已加载字节及请求释放；只有错误的 RX 事件绝不虚构数据。SPI 与 I2C 保持有界轮询合同，控制器恢复绝不重放失败事务。Flash "
"暴露物理几何；产品提供显式受限区域。"

#: ../../../../io/README.md:46
msgid ""
"The Native model owns independent state per instance. Its explicit default "
"fixtures support focused tests; generated assemblies use separate state and "
"buffers. Native behavior, production-register fault models and ARM link "
"fixtures establish software evidence. Board facts authorize reviewed "
"physical routes; software-only fixtures do not establish PCB connectivity or"
" physical timing."
msgstr ""
"Native 模型为每实例保留独立状态。其显式默认夹具用于聚焦测试；生成装配使用独立状态和缓冲区。Native 行为、生产寄存器故障模型及 ARM "
"链接夹具建立软件证据。Board 事实授权已审查物理路由；仅软件夹具不建立 PCB 连通性或物理时序。"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/source-map.md:35
msgid "OS adapters"
msgstr "OS 适配器"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:2
msgid "Optional OS adapters"
msgstr "可选 OS 适配器"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Thin wait/wake and per-object storage contracts. Baremetal has no scheduler;"
" Native uses POSIX threads; FreeRTOS uses explicit static TCB, stack and "
"queue storage selected by the caller. No universal maximum pool, hidden "
"worker, default timer daemon or device dependency on OS."
msgstr ""
"轻量 wait/wake 与每对象存储合同。裸机没有调度器；Native 使用 POSIX 线程；FreeRTOS 使用调用者选择的显式静态 "
"TCB、栈及队列存储。不使用通用最大对象池、隐藏执行任务、默认定时器 daemon，也不让设备依赖 OS。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:9
msgid ""
"Notifications are hints: arm/recheck the authoritative request predicate. "
"Kernel ISR operations validate the selected syscall ceiling. Native task "
"return ends the pthread; FreeRTOS wrappers publish completion and suspend "
"until external deletion; ThreadX wrappers enter the kernel completion path. "
"The one external lifecycle owner must successfully join before reclaiming "
"wrapper, TCB or stack storage. Completion hints alone do not prove kernel "
"detachment. Applications own scheduler start, workers, queue depth, fairness"
" and shutdown progress."
msgstr ""
"通知是提示：arm 后重新检查权威请求谓词。内核 ISR 操作验证选定系统调用阈值。Native 任务返回后 pthread 结束；FreeRTOS "
"包装函数发布完成并挂起，等待外部删除；ThreadX 包装函数进入内核完成路径。唯一外部生命周期所有者必须成功 join，才能回收包装状态、TCB "
"或栈存储。只有完成提示不能证明内核引用已撤离。应用拥有调度器启动、执行任务、队列深度、公平性及停机推进。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:17
msgid ""
"The real FreeRTOS POSIX scheduler fixture validates host task/queue "
"lifecycle. The default privileged runtime selects exact pinned kernel "
"sources from validated CPU facts: CM0 for M0/M0+, CM3 integer context for M3"
" and M4 without FP, CM4F for M4 with FP, CM7/r0p1 for M7 with FP, and each "
"CM23/33/55/85 NTZ port with its separate assembly file. Integer-only M7 uses"
" a reviewed build-derived CM3 port with PRIMASK-preserving errata 837070 "
"guards; pinned vendor files remain unchanged. Host execution does not "
"qualify MCU exception priority, FP/MVE context switches, stack high-water or"
" timing."
msgstr ""
"真实 FreeRTOS POSIX 调度器夹具验证主机任务／队列生命周期。默认特权 runtime 根据已验证 CPU "
"事实选入准确锁定内核源：M0/M0+ 使用 CM0；M3 及无 FP 的 M4 使用 CM3 整数上下文；有 FP 的 M4 使用 CM4F；有 FP "
"的 M7 使用 CM7/r0p1；CM23/33/55/85 则使用各自 NTZ 端口及独立汇编文件。纯整数 M7 使用已审查、构建派生的 CM3 "
"端口，加入保持 PRIMASK 的勘误 837070 防护；锁定厂商文件保持不变。主机执行不建立 MCU 异常优先级、FP/MVE "
"上下文切换、栈高水位或时序资格。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:26
msgid ""
"Running APIs require privileged, unmasked Thread mode. Before scheduler "
"start, the pinned Baseline ports may retain PRIMASK=1 and Mainline ports "
"their exact syscall BASEPRI; only that port's canonical mask is permitted in"
" that phase. Matching a value cannot identify its owner. Fault masks and "
"other masks reject before object mutation; a read-only scheduler query "
"distinguishes bootstrap from running/suspended tasks. Baseline IRQ wakes use"
" the PRIMASK kernel contract; Mainline IRQ wakes validate implemented "
"bounds, priority width and syscall ceiling."
msgstr ""
"运行期 API 要求特权且未屏蔽的 Thread 模式。调度器启动前，锁定 Baseline 端口可能保留 PRIMASK=1，Mainline "
"端口保留准确 syscall "
"BASEPRI；该阶段只允许所选端口的规范屏蔽状态。数值匹配不能证明所有者身份。故障屏蔽或其他屏蔽状态在对象变更前拒绝；只读调度器查询区分 "
"bootstrap 与运行／挂起任务。Baseline IRQ 唤醒使用 PRIMASK 内核合同；Mainline IRQ "
"唤醒检查实现边界、优先级位宽及系统调用阈值。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:34
msgid ""
"Armv8-M supports explicit NTZ, Secure-only, and Nonsecure standalone build "
"modes. The selected NTZ kernels do not allocate Secure task contexts or "
"expose cross-world Secure function calls. Secure startup owns SAU/IDAU and "
"Nonsecure coprocessor access; Nonsecure local masking cannot protect against"
" Secure publishers. The default task APIs remain privileged; explicit MPU "
"profiles provide a separate static restricted-task lifecycle and two "
"pointer-free user delay/tick SVC services. Caller-owned protected metadata "
"and reviewed user linker regions are required; no generic user-object pool "
"or privileged I/O API is exposed. M0/M0+ and M7 MPU, and MPU combined with "
"split security, are rejected. See the OS contracts and current matrix before"
" selecting an optional isolation profile."
msgstr ""
"Armv8-M 支持显式 NTZ、Secure-only 及独立 Nonsecure 构建模式。选定 NTZ 内核不分配 Secure "
"任务上下文，也不暴露跨世界 Secure 函数调用。Secure startup 拥有 SAU/IDAU 与 Nonsecure "
"协处理器访问；Nonsecure 本地屏蔽不能防护 Secure 发布者。默认任务 API 保持特权；显式 MPU "
"配置提供独立静态受限任务生命周期和两个无指针用户 delay/tick SVC "
"服务。必须提供调用者自有受保护元数据及已审查用户链接区域；不暴露通用用户对象池或特权 I/O API。M0/M0+、M7 MPU 以及 MPU "
"与分裂安全状态组合均被拒绝。选择可选隔离配置前必须查看 OS 合同及当前矩阵。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:45
msgid ""
"Explicit split mode instead selects the real TrustZone-aware Nonsecure ports"
" and a separately linked Secure baremetal Runtime with "
"`Nexus::SecureContext`. Both images use matching CPU/ABI facts and the "
"actual CMSE import/SG veneers. Every authorized task, including Idle, has "
"caller-owned NS TCB/stack and prepared Secure metadata/stack selected by an "
"immutable trusted mapping. No Secure heap or maximum context pool is "
"supplied. The NS privileged kernel is trusted; SAU/IDAU, startup, vectors, "
"NSC memory attribution and interrupt routing remain consumer/SoC "
"responsibilities. See the [Secure companion "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/os/freertos/secure/README.md) before integration. Two-image linking "
"and host lease tests do not qualify physical attribution, context retention,"
" stack peaks or adversarial NS-kernel isolation."
msgstr ""
"显式 split 模式选择真实 TrustZone 感知 Nonsecure 端口，及独立链接、带 `Nexus::SecureContext` 的 "
"Secure 裸机 Runtime。两个镜像使用匹配 CPU/ABI 事实及真实 CMSE import/SG veneers。包括 Idle "
"在内的每个授权任务，都拥有调用者提供的 NS TCB／栈，以及由不可变可信映射选择的已准备 Secure 元数据／栈。不提供 Secure "
"堆或最大上下文池。NS 特权内核被信任；SAU/IDAU、startup、向量表、NSC 内存属性和中断路由仍由消费者／SoC 负责。集成前阅读 "
"[Secure 配套合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/os/freertos/secure/README.md)。双镜像链接与主机租约测试不建立物理属性、上下文保持、栈峰值或对抗恶意 NS "
"内核的隔离资格。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:57
msgid ""
"The first scheduler start requires cold privileged Thread/MSP state with "
"FPCA clear; applications must not leave active FP context before bootstrap. "
"The MPU start guard consumes a protected single-use lease against the real "
"origin/frame. For v8-M, authored `security = \"single\"` means Arch state 0,"
" not Nonsecure. It uses the traditional FD/F9 port return tuple without CMSE"
" permission; explicit Secure uses the same tuple with its separate Secure "
"facts, while explicit Nonsecure uses BC/B8. The generated "
"`NEXUS_CPU_SECURE_ONLY` macro selects that port encoding and does not grant "
"Secure access to a single-world image."
msgstr ""
"第一次调度器启动要求冷态特权 Thread/MSP 且 FPCA 清零；应用不得在 bootstrap 前留下活动 FP 上下文。MPU "
"启动防护依据真实来源／异常帧消费受保护的一次性租约。v8-M 中，配置声明的 `security = \"single\"` 表示 Arch 状态 "
"0，而不是 Nonsecure。它使用传统 FD/F9 端口返回元组，不具备 CMSE 权限；显式 Secure 使用相同元组，但具有独立 Secure"
" 事实；显式 Nonsecure 使用 BC/B8。生成的 `NEXUS_CPU_SECURE_ONLY` 宏选择该端口编码，不向单世界镜像授予 "
"Secure 访问权限。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:66
msgid ""
"M55/M85 use their actual MVE-aware exception/context ports. The kernel's "
"`configENABLE_FPU` switch activates the shared coprocessor register bank and"
" extended/lazy exception frame for either FP or MVE; CPU scalar-FP facts "
"remain independent. Integer-only MVE compiles with `+nofp` and softfp "
"calling convention. Upper shared registers are saved by the port. Complete "
"lower-bank and VPR retention depends on hardware extended exception framing "
"and remains part of physical context-switch acceptance. This build contract "
"does not qualify that behavior or guarantee cross-world payload "
"preservation."
msgstr ""
"M55/M85 使用真实、感知 MVE 的异常／上下文端口。内核 `configENABLE_FPU` 开关为 FP 或 MVE "
"激活共享协处理器寄存器组及扩展／惰性异常帧；CPU 标量 FP 事实保持独立。纯整数 MVE 使用 `+nofp` 和 softfp "
"调用约定编译。共享上半寄存器由端口保存；完整下半寄存器与 VPR "
"保持依赖硬件扩展异常帧，仍属于物理上下文切换验收。此构建合同不建立该行为资格，也不保证跨世界载荷保持。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:75
msgid ""
"The host fixture keeps the pinned kernel and POSIX port unchanged, and uses "
"`tests/contracts/os_freertos_runtime/posix_event.c` as its owned event "
"support. The port cancels cond-waiting pthreads before signalling/joining "
"them; upstream event support has no cancellation cleanup and can leave an "
"exited thread's mutex locked. Owned waits unlock on both return and "
"cancellation, preventing repeated task-join deadlocks. This host-only "
"correction does not change the MCU backend or establish MCU scheduler "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"主机夹具保持锁定内核与 POSIX 端口不变，并使用 "
"`tests/contracts/os_freertos_runtime/posix_event.c` 作为自有事件支持。端口在发信号／join "
"之前取消条件变量等待中的 pthread；上游事件支持没有取消清理，可能使已退出线程的 mutex 保持锁定。自有等待在返回与取消时均解锁，避免重复任务"
" join 死锁。该主机修正不改变 MCU 后端，也不建立 MCU 调度器资格。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:83
msgid "Maintained execution contracts"
msgstr "维护范围内的执行合同"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:85
msgid ""
"See [OS contracts](/design/os-contracts.md), [delivery "
"scope](/delivery/os.md) and the {download}`OS01-OS55 execution ledger "
"</design/os-execution.csv>`. New-kernel admission uses the [backend "
"integration contract](/design/os-backend-integration.md) and its active "
"execution probe; a probe pass does not register another supported RTOS."
msgstr ""
"参见 [OS 合同](/design/os-contracts.md)、[交付范围](/delivery/os.md)及 "
"{download}`OS01-OS55 执行台账 </design/os-"
"execution.csv>`。新内核准入遵守[后端接入合同](/design/os-backend-"
"integration.md)及主动执行探针；探针通过不登记另一个已支持 RTOS。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:92
msgid ""
"Finite notification deadlines are checked even after a coalesced sequence "
"hint; continuous unrelated wakes cannot extend a wait. The public predicate "
"receives one final observation after timeout, so an observed real completion"
" can win. Queue operations keep immediate try semantics and consume an "
"absolute budget only when blocking. `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` uses genuine untimed"
" host waiting."
msgstr ""
"即使序列提示已合并，仍检查有限通知截止时间；持续无关唤醒不能延长等待。超时后公共谓词获得最后一次观察机会，因此观察到真实完成仍可返回成功。队列操作保持立即尝试语义，只在阻塞时消耗绝对预算。`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`"
" 使用真正无超时的主机等待。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:98
msgid ""
"Task creation validates the selected port's startup frame and alignment "
"before kernel mutation. Startup minimum and measured runtime stack budget "
"remain distinct. One external lifecycle owner joins each returning task. "
"Native tasks must not be cancelled or detached behind the adapter. Permanent"
" tasks and direct notifications are explicit optional paths with their own "
"storage and receiver/index contracts."
msgstr ""
"任务创建在修改内核之前验证选定端口的启动帧与对齐。启动最小栈和实测运行期栈预算保持区分。每个返回型任务由唯一外部生命周期所有者 "
"join。不得在适配器背后取消或 detach Native 任务。永久任务及直接通知是显式可选路径，分别具有存储及接收者／索引合同。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:104
msgid ""
"Closable queues use separate caller-owned controls and per-operation waiter "
"storage; raw queues retain their minimal native blocking implementation. "
"Shutdown must close admission, keep the owner progressing, settle and join "
"producers, join the owner, quiesce hardware IRQ publishers and only then "
"destroy notification, queue and guard storage. The external UART owner "
"example demonstrates that flow."
msgstr ""
"可关闭队列使用独立、调用者拥有的控制及每操作等待者存储；原始队列保留最小原生阻塞实现。停机必须关闭准入、保持 owner 推进、完成并排空并 join "
"生产者、join owner、使硬件 IRQ 发布者静止，最后才能销毁通知、队列与 guard 存储。外部 UART owner 示例展示该流程。"

#: ../../../../os/README.md:110
msgid ""
"The optional tickless path needs an explicitly bound timer port and a "
"continuous clock; without it, normal Tick remains active. Diagnostics use "
"caller-sized rings and weak no-op sinks. Trace, low power and task isolation"
" do not imply physical qualification. `tools/hil/os_acceptance.py` prepares "
"or verifies retained OS hardware records without operating equipment; all "
"unexecuted physical cases stay `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"可选 tickless 路径要求显式绑定定时器端口及连续时钟；未供给时正常 Tick 继续运行。诊断采用调用者确定容量的环与 weak "
"空操作接收端。跟踪、低功耗及任务隔离不表示物理资格。`tools/hil/os_acceptance.py` 只准备或验证保留的 OS "
"硬件记录，不操作设备；全部尚未执行的物理用例保持 `not_executed`。"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/source-map.md:42
msgid "Components"
msgstr "组件"

#: ../../../../components/README.md:2
msgid "Optional common components"
msgstr "可选通用组件"

#: ../../../../components/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Explicit CMake targets compose narrow ports: bounded BusOwner, SPI/UART "
"owner, BMP280 core and SPI transport, instance-level Log, two-bank commit-"
"last Storage, physical Flash region and Native file adapters, and pure "
"Modbus RTU parsing. Unreferenced component code does not enter a firmware "
"image."
msgstr ""
"显式 CMake 目标组合窄端口：有界 BusOwner、SPI/UART owner、BMP280 核心与 SPI 传输、实例级 Log、双 bank"
" 最后提交标记 Storage、物理 Flash 区域及 Native 文件适配器、纯 Modbus RTU 解析。未被引用组件代码不进入固件镜像。"

#: ../../../../components/README.md:9
msgid ""
"Owners have one executor, exact slot capacity, stable cancellation epochs "
"and caller-owned operations. Initialization links unused slots before "
"publication. Admission removes one free slot and appends one FIFO entry "
"under the metadata guard; settlement/rejection returns one reusable slot. "
"Both use constant work independent of capacity. The same slot link serves "
"the free or FIFO chain, with one free-head index per owner and no extra per-"
"slot storage. A slot reaching its final epoch is permanently retired, never "
"rebound with a repeated identity. UART's explicit inner provider request "
"lets the owner release the outer request only after its last access. Devices"
" and protocols do not choose Board pins, product registers, default workers "
"or global lookup. Products supply transports, authorization, regions, task "
"policy and budgets."
msgstr ""
"Owner 具有唯一执行者、准确槽容量、稳定取消 epoch "
"及调用者拥有的操作。初始化在发布之前连接尚未使用的槽。准入在元数据临界区中移除一个空闲槽并追加一个 FIFO "
"条目；完成并排空／拒绝归还一个可复用槽。两者的工作量固定，不随容量变化。同一个槽链接服务于空闲链或 FIFO 链；每个 owner 仅有一个 free-"
"head 索引，不增加逐槽存储。达到最后 epoch 的槽永久退役，不使用重复身份重新绑定。UART 显式内层提供者请求使 owner "
"仅在自身最后一次访问之后释放外层请求。设备及协议不选择 Board 引脚、产品寄存器、默认执行任务或全局查找。产品供给传输、授权、区域、任务策略及预算。"

#: ../../../../components/README.md:21
msgid ""
"Meaningful regressions in `tests/contracts` cover concurrent producers, late"
" cancel/TC, failure quarantine, interrupted persistence and protocol "
"malformed inputs. A durable host file is not a physical Flash power-cut "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"`tests/contracts` 中的有效回归覆盖并发生产者、延后取消／TC、失败隔离保留、持久化中断及协议畸形输入。持久主机文件不建立物理 "
"Flash 断电资格。"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/source-map.md:49
msgid "Exact SoC implementations"
msgstr "准确 SoC 实现"

#: ../../../../docs/explanation/source-map.md:51
msgid ""
"The private implementation boundaries and reference configurations are "
"maintained in [STM32F103](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f103/README.md), "
"[GD32F303](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/gd32f303/README.md), [STM32F407](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/README.md), "
"[GD32F470](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/gd32f470/README.md), [STM32G474](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32g474/README.md), "
"[STM32H743](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md) and [STM32U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/README.md). Their "
"links bind this website revision."
msgstr ""
"私有实现边界与参考配置由 [STM32F103](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32f103/README.md)、[GD32F303](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/gd32f303/README.md)、[STM32F407](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32f407/README.md)、[GD32F470](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/gd32f470/README.md)、[STM32G474](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32g474/README.md)、[STM32H743](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32h743/README.md) 和 "
"[STM32U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32u575/README.md) 维护。这些链接绑定当前站点源码版本。"

#: ../../../../io/README.md:4
msgid ""
"GPIO, UART, SPI, I2C, Flash, watchdog, EXTI, PWM and ADC expose C11 "
"interfaces. The optional [GPIO pin-state contract](/explanation/gpio-pin-"
"states.md) adds an explicit selected face for authored DEFAULT/SLEEP images."
" Its generated instance ID and runtime selection enum remain separate; "
"lookup never acquires pad ownership or starts a power transition. Each "
"selected instance has an immutable face with two pointers: shared read-only "
"methods and a pointer to private provider state. Generated faces live in "
"read-only storage; their state and selected buffers are private static "
"objects in the generated translation unit. Manually assembled providers use "
"storage supplied by their explicit constructor owner. A 32-bit target spends"
" eight bytes of Flash per face; mutable state and exact-capacity buffers are"
" separate. Method pointers are shared per provider and mode rather than "
"repeated in every mutable instance."
msgstr ""
"GPIO、UART、SPI、I2C、Flash、watchdog、EXTI、PWM、ADC 提供 C11 接口。可选的 [GPIO "
"引脚状态合同](/explanation/gpio-pin-states.md) 为显式编写的 DEFAULT/SLEEP 图像增加选定接口面。生成实例"
" ID 与运行时选择枚举保持分离；查找既不取得 pad "
